---
title: CubeForge — Flujo de datos de un solve (2026-08-12)
---
%% Flujo verificado contra hooks/stores reales (Fases 1-3).

flowchart LR
    subgraph Hardware["Entrada de hardware (HAL)"]
        cube["GanCubeAdapter / GanCubeAdapterTauri<br/>(BLE, ClockDriftReconciler)"]
        timerHW["GanTimerAdapter / GanTimerAdapterTauri"]
        stackmat["StackmatAdapter (audio)"]
    end

    timer["@cubalyze/timer-engine<br/>(TimerEngine: fases + penalizaciones)"]
    timerStore["timerStore (idle→cooldown…)"]
    solveSession["useSolveSession<br/>(registro de movimientos wide)"]
    sessionStore["sessionStore + solves"]
    db["SQLite (worker Comlink)<br/>OPFS (web) / nativa (desktop)"]
    analysis["@cubalyze/analysis-engine<br/>(pipeline versionado)"]
    widgets["Widgets (times-log, stats,<br/>pb-progression, phase-balance…)"]
    insights["Vistas Insights + Training<br/>(estadísticas, SRS/FSRS)"]

    cube -->|"moves$ facelets$"| solveSession
    timerHW -->|"hardwareDown/Up/Reset"| timer
    stackmat --> timer
    timer --> timerStore
    timerStore --> solveSession
    solveSession -->|"Solve"| sessionStore
    sessionStore -->|"persist"| db
    db -->|"solves readonly"| widgets
    db --> analysis
    analysis --> insights
    solveSession -->|"evento solve:completed"| widgets
